description=Unofficial performance patch. Spreads AmmoMaker's casing clean-up and vanilla farming's plant checks over several ticks instead of one frozen frame every ten in-game minutes, drops casing entries that have nothing left to clean, and holds back Tuna's gun and equipment rack scans while no rack is near, remembers which item types are night-vision goggles for Night Vision Framework, and makes This Is Your Life look through your inventory for a new journal once a second instead of every tick, and runs Better Building Plus's scaffold tick four times a second instead of every tick. Works best with Chunk Load Sieve 1.2. Does not modify any other mod's files.
